=\"https://clusters.soleilpictures.com/email/2026-11-02-new-look.jpg\" alt=\"The new look, with &quot;quotes&quot; &amp; &lt;angles&gt;\" width=\"440\" style=\"width:100%; max-width:440px; height:auto; display:block; border-radius:10px; border:1px solid #e7e4df;\"></a></p><table role=\"presentation\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"margin:0 0 18px;\"><tr><td style=\"padding:0 0 9px; font:400 15px/1.6 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; color:#1a1a1a;\"><span style=\"color:#8a8780;\">&middot;</span>&nbsp;&nbsp;Plain item with &lt;b&gt;tags&lt;/b&gt; &amp; ampersands</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:0 0 9px; font:400 15px/1.6 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; color:#1a1a1a;\"><span style=\"color:#8a8780;\">&middot;</span>&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong style=\"font-weight:600;\">Faster boards.</strong> Opening a cluster is quicker, &quot;really&quot; &amp; truly.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:0 0 9px; font:400 15px/1.6 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; color:#1a1a1a;\"><span style=\"color:#8a8780;\">&middot;</span>&nbsp;&nbsp;Another plain item, it&#39;s short</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:0 0 9px; font:400 15px/1.6 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; color:#1a1a1a;\"><span style=\"color:#8a8780;\">&middot;</span>&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong style=\"font-weight:600;\">Tags &lt;new&gt;</strong> Auto-tag now handles Andrew&#39;s photos &amp; PDFs.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:0 0 9px; font:400 15px/1.6 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; color:#1a1a1a;\"><span style=\"color:#8a8780;\">&middot;</span>&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong style=\"font-weight:600;\">Together.</strong> Work live with someone and earn cards.</td></tr></table><p style=\"margin:0 0 18px; font:400 15px/1.65 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; color:#1a1a1a;\">That&#39;s it for now. Reply if anything looks off &amp; we&#39;ll fix it.</p><table role=\"presentation\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"margin:6px 0 18px;\">\n                  <tr>\n                    <td bgcolor=\"#1a1a1a\" style=\"background:#1a1a1a; border-radius:8px;\">\n                      <a href=\"https://clusters.soleilpictures.com/resume?rt=bbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbb&amp;w=11111111-2222-4333-8444-555555555555&amp;b=66666666-7777-4888-8999-aaaaaaaaaaaa&amp;utm_source=email&amp;utm_medium=lifecycle&amp;utm_campaign=product_update&amp;lc=product_update.2026-10-31\" style=\"display:inline-block; padding:0 24px; height:46px; line-height:46px; font:600 15px/46px -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; color:#faf9f7; text-decoration:none; border-radius:8px;\">See what&#39;s new &rarr;</a>\n                    </td>\n                  </tr>\n                </table><p style=\"margin:0 0 18px; font:400 15px/1.65 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; color:#1a1a1a;\">Andrew<br>Soleil Pictures</p>\n              </td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td style=\"padding-top:30px;\">\n                <div style=\"border-top:1px solid #e7e4df; padding-top:18px; font:400 12px/1.6 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; color:#8a8780; text-align:left;\">\n                  Soleil Pictures · 800 Peachtree St NE, Apt 8210, Atlanta, GA 30308<br>\n                  Not into these? <a href=\"https://clusters.soleilpictures.com/api/unsubscribe?u=aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa&amp;k=email_lifecycle\" style=\"color:#8a8780; text-decoration:underline;\">Unsubscribe</a>.\n                </div>\n              </td>\n            </tr>\n          </table>\n        </td>\n      </tr>\n    </table>\n  </body>\n</html>",
